      "content": "yeah, i'll check the queue depths. it's just frustrating because everything seems fine one minute and then completely broken the next. it's like there's some kind of ghost in the machine causing these random spikes. do you think anything else could cause such weird, unpredictable behavior without showing up in the logs?",
